<h1>Edit agent: reporter-aws</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Pick a role and a desk - the preset fills in typical skills and permissions; fine-tune with the checkboxes below. The job description assembles itself and stays visible in the personnel file.</p>

<form method="post" action="/staff/reporter-aws/update" class="hireform"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<CSRF>">
